sequenceDiagram
  participant W1 as Old worker (epoch 7)
  participant St as Store
  participant W2 as New worker
  W1->>W1: long pause, the lease expires
  W2->>St: takes the partition, epoch 8
  W1->>St: writes results with epoch 7
  St-->>W1: 0 rows, stale epoch
  W2->>St: writes results with epoch 8
  St-->>W2: committed
